<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <apiVersion>62.0</apiVersion>
    <assignments>
        <name>Compose_And_Set_Message</name>
        <label>Compose And Set Message</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>400</locationY>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>$Record.Pending_Slack_Message__c</assignToReference>
            <operator>Assign</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>AlertMessageTemplate</elementReference>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
    </assignments>
    <decisions>
        <name>Should_Alert</name>
        <label>Should Alert?</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>280</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>No</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Alert_Needed</name>
            <label>Alert Needed</label>
            <conditionLogic>(1 AND 2) OR (3 AND 4)</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Status__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Blocked</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Status__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsChanged</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Due_Date__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsChanged</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Due_Date__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>GreaterThan</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <elementReference>$Record__Prior.Due_Date__c</elementReference>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Compose_And_Set_Message</targetReference>
            </connector>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>Status가 Blocked로 바뀌거나 Due Date가 이전 값보다 늦춰지면(Before-Save라 $Record__Prior 비교 가능), 그 순간의 정확한 값으로 Slack 메시지를 조립해 Pending_Slack_Message__c에 저장합니다. After-Save 비동기 Flow(Campaign_Deliverable_Blocked_Slack_Alert)는 이 필드를 그대로 읽어 발송하므로, 비동기 실행 시점에 값이 이미 바뀌어 있어도(예: 곧바로 되돌려진 경우) 저장 당시의 정확한 내용이 보존됩니다.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>Due_Date_Korean</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(
    ISBLANK({!$Record.Due_Date__c}),
    &quot;미정&quot;,
    TEXT(YEAR({!$Record.Due_Date__c})) &amp; &quot;년 &quot; &amp; TEXT(MONTH({!$Record.Due_Date__c})) &amp; &quot;월 &quot; &amp; TEXT(DAY({!$Record.Due_Date__c})) &amp; &quot;일&quot;
)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>Notes_Or_Empty</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(ISBLANK({!$Record.Notes__c}), &quot;(없음)&quot;, {!$Record.Notes__c})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>Campaign Deliverable Detect Due Date Push {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Campaign Deliverable Detect Due Date Push</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>CanvasMode</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>AUTO_LAYOUT_CANVAS</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processType>AutoLaunchedFlow</processType>
    <start>
        <locationX>50</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Should_Alert</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <doesRequireRecordChangedToMeetCriteria>false</doesRequireRecordChangedToMeetCriteria>
        <filterLogic>1 or 2</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Status__c</field>
            <operator>IsChanged</operator>
            <value>
                <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <filters>
            <field>Due_Date__c</field>
            <operator>IsChanged</operator>
            <value>
                <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <object>Campaign_Deliverable__c</object>
        <recordTriggerType>Update</recordTriggerType>
        <triggerType>RecordBeforeSave</triggerType>
    </start>
    <status>Active</status>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>AlertMessageTemplate</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>⚠️ *[{!$Record.Campaign__r.Name}]* 실행 지연
항목: {!$Record.Name}
사유: {!$Record.Blocked_Reason__c}
메모: {!Notes_Or_Empty}
Due Date: {!Due_Date_Korean}</text>
    </textTemplates>
</Flow>
